WEBVTT

00:13.200 --> 00:15.740
kimi to ireba

00:13.200 --> 00:15.740
If I’m with you -

00:15.740 --> 00:18.580
kimi to itara

00:15.740 --> 00:18.580
because I’m with you -

00:18.580 --> 00:23.210
kokoro ga yasuraku

00:18.580 --> 00:23.210
my heart is at ease.

00:24.170 --> 00:26.750
kimi mo soude

00:24.170 --> 00:26.750
Surely, you’re the same.

00:26.750 --> 00:32.300
kimi mo ima yasurakerute

00:26.750 --> 00:32.300
You’re at ease now, too.

00:33.340 --> 00:39.930
itekuretara ii noni

00:33.340 --> 00:39.930
If you can just admit it,

00:41.680 --> 00:45.270
sono mama

00:41.680 --> 00:45.270
for even time to forget us,

00:46.230 --> 00:59.410
jikan saemo wasuresouna kurai shizen dakara

00:46.230 --> 00:59.410
it’s only natural, at this rate.

01:00.160 --> 01:10.880
yubisaki kara koboreochiru violet wo yo

01:00.160 --> 01:10.880
Violet drops, falling slowly from our fingertips…

01:10.880 --> 01:17.760
chiisana yume egaite yukou

01:10.880 --> 01:17.760
“Let us follow that small dream with a smile!”

01:17.760 --> 01:23.680
futaride sasayaka na

01:17.760 --> 01:23.680
And just like that, we are happy

01:25.100 --> 01:29.310
kotoba ga ureshii

01:25.100 --> 01:29.310
over such trifling words

01:29.810 --> 01:34.030
somatteku sora

01:29.810 --> 01:34.030
that paint the sky.

01:50.880 --> 01:55.340
Heart of Light, Heart of Darkness

01:54.140 --> 01:55.710
Warin, Sam…

01:56.340 --> 01:59.000
Priestess of the Sea, Priestess of the Sky…

01:59.000 --> 02:01.260
We shall pass judgment on you.

02:03.190 --> 02:05.570
Ichikawa, wake up!

02:06.410 --> 02:08.730
The sacred blood of the sea turtles has been passed down to you.

02:08.730 --> 02:11.520
You should be able to fight against the dark power of Sedona!

02:12.220 --> 02:13.820
Be quiet, you old turtle!

02:14.030 --> 02:14.860
What?

02:15.650 --> 02:17.240
You’re a turtle too!

02:17.700 --> 02:19.350
I know that.

02:20.010 --> 02:25.110
It was you who wanted to destroy Sedona and the transformed Urin.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.200
How mean.

02:28.500 --> 02:31.160
I can’t believe that Marin would do such a thing.

02:31.180 --> 02:31.750
No!

02:32.500 --> 02:35.300
Marin doesn’t love Urin anymore?

02:35.920 --> 02:37.090
You’re wrong!

02:37.090 --> 02:40.300
Yeah! Marin isn’t even thinking those things!

02:40.850 --> 02:42.100
Really?

02:42.100 --> 02:45.000
It’s true! Believe me, Warin!

02:45.800 --> 02:46.950
That’s good.

02:47.520 --> 02:50.720
The Marin I know wouldn’t do such a thing.

02:50.720 --> 02:52.400
Right. I’m relieved.

02:55.290 --> 02:57.070
But I was right. The one to blame…

02:57.750 --> 03:00.990
The one who thinks Urin is a bother is the Elder Turtle.

03:03.170 --> 03:06.660
And the Priestess of the Sky, who took Marin away, too.

03:09.080 --> 03:10.370
No! Kanon, she…

03:34.610 --> 03:35.350
Elder!

03:35.360 --> 03:36.110
Hold on!

03:36.110 --> 03:37.480
Stop it, Sam!

03:38.910 --> 03:39.490
Warin…

03:40.150 --> 03:42.990
Hurry, go and look for Urin.

03:43.530 --> 03:44.410
She’s waiting for you.

03:45.370 --> 03:46.370
But…

03:47.230 --> 03:51.750
You don’t need to mind the business of Sky people.

03:51.750 --> 03:55.840
I can’t… I can’t save Urin without Kanon-chan!

03:56.170 --> 03:59.130
Sam! Wait! Kanon-chan didn’t do anything wrong!

04:00.380 --> 04:03.340
She doesn’t have anything you need to save Urin, does she?

04:05.090 --> 04:07.890
Marin just got tainted by the darkness along with her.

04:08.680 --> 04:09.970
It’s that easy, right?

04:10.670 --> 04:11.770
Warin…

04:12.690 --> 04:15.270
Fight! Priestess of the Sky, Priestess of the Sea!

04:15.860 --> 04:18.070
They are not your friends, like they used to be!

04:21.860 --> 04:24.360
Yes, even if it is my own daughter!

04:33.370 --> 04:36.250
No matter who it is, Marin would easily like that person.

04:36.250 --> 04:38.960
Your bright heart is too strong.

04:39.480 --> 04:43.750
Because of liking the Sky people, things turned out like this.

04:43.750 --> 04:46.430
So now, discard your light.

04:47.660 --> 04:51.080
You don’t have to like anyone anymore.

04:51.080 --> 04:54.990
If that heart of light would disappear from this world,

04:54.990 --> 04:56.850
no one would feel the pain anymore.

04:57.550 --> 04:59.110
Sorrow would disappear, too.

05:00.770 --> 05:03.070
Warin, you’re in pain, aren’t you?

05:04.360 --> 05:09.180
Your heart was tainted by Sedona’s darkness… It seems painful.

05:09.920 --> 05:12.540
My heart…

05:13.330 --> 05:16.960
No one really wanted this to happen.

05:17.330 --> 05:21.420
Ichikawa-san, who finally met her father, was supposed to be really happy.

05:27.590 --> 05:28.430
Light…

05:45.020 --> 05:48.860
To protect the sea and sky, O great light,

05:49.970 --> 05:51.830
shine over…

05:54.250 --> 05:55.960
…the darkness.

06:44.300 --> 06:45.050
Warin!

06:46.510 --> 06:47.380
Huh?

06:50.530 --> 06:51.180
Sam?

06:54.370 --> 06:55.930
Marin’s power didn’t work!

06:56.830 --> 06:57.540
Marin!

07:04.740 --> 07:06.760
Sam, pull yourself together!

07:16.730 --> 07:18.550
Do it, Priestess of the Sky!

07:18.540 --> 07:19.620
Don’t!

07:20.410 --> 07:23.540
The only one we want to defeat is Sedona!

07:25.460 --> 07:26.180
I understand.

07:28.010 --> 07:29.210
What foolishness.

07:29.210 --> 07:30.780
Let her go!

07:39.610 --> 07:40.230
Not good!

07:44.630 --> 07:46.860
I was kicked aside…

07:52.630 --> 07:55.530
Kanon, we’ll…

07:58.100 --> 08:01.190
Combine our powers.

08:48.810 --> 08:52.970
Those two Priestesses can free the light that makes darkness disappear.

09:04.930 --> 09:08.210
They are sleeping well. We can relax now.

09:09.200 --> 09:14.200
If I combine my powers with Kanon’s, we’ll definitely be able to save Urin.

09:14.200 --> 09:18.210
It does seem like your powers have gotten stronger.

09:18.210 --> 09:21.990
No one has ever loosed such strong light before.

09:22.720 --> 09:27.070
Maybe it can really fight against Sedona.

09:27.070 --> 09:31.620
However, Sedona also has powers that have never been used before.

09:32.270 --> 09:34.010
We can’t be too careless.

09:36.160 --> 09:37.360
What are you guys doing?

09:37.360 --> 09:41.980
Oh, Mom. Marin’s friends don’t feel good,

09:41.970 --> 09:45.060
so they’re just sleeping here.

09:45.770 --> 09:46.840
Mom?

09:46.850 --> 09:52.320
Do whatever you want. It is not like you’re going to listen to me.

09:54.190 --> 09:56.740
I won’t worry about you anymore.

09:56.740 --> 09:58.740
Whatever.

09:59.700 --> 10:02.490
She is being affected by Sedona’s power.

10:02.490 --> 10:05.960
I never knew that she was so pure.

10:05.960 --> 10:08.410
Those words weren’t from her heart.

10:08.410 --> 10:09.860
I wonder…

10:12.150 --> 10:12.880
It’s nothing.

10:13.660 --> 10:17.440
Kojima, Suzuki and Ooshima are suffering right now.

10:17.440 --> 10:20.440
We need to save everyone as soon as possible.

10:20.440 --> 10:21.510
Urin, too.

10:22.680 --> 10:24.570
Don’t forget Ichikawa.

10:24.570 --> 10:26.100
I know.

10:26.100 --> 10:31.090
Also, I will be coming along. If…

10:32.110 --> 10:36.340
If I was controlled by Sedona,

10:36.340 --> 10:39.720
don’t hesitate to take me down. Remember that.

10:39.720 --> 10:40.710
Understood!

10:42.400 --> 10:44.120
Just kidding.

11:12.360 --> 11:15.860
What’s going on? The evil power has been weakened.

11:16.410 --> 11:18.030
Where is Urin?

11:18.030 --> 11:21.320
Urin? Urin? Where are you?

11:22.460 --> 11:23.730
Urin!

11:23.730 --> 11:25.660
Urin!

11:40.510 --> 11:44.060
Turtle, can you explain what is going on?

11:45.350 --> 11:46.560
I have no idea.

11:47.220 --> 11:51.670
Could it be that Urin got purified along with Sedona?

11:51.670 --> 11:52.720
What?!

11:52.720 --> 11:55.140
Oh, that is possible.

11:55.140 --> 11:56.980
That is impossible!

11:57.400 --> 12:00.940
Why? Who knows what happened?

12:02.020 --> 12:03.940
That’s true…

12:03.960 --> 12:05.910
But where is Urin?

12:07.110 --> 12:07.870
Maybe she went home.

12:08.170 --> 12:11.290
Oh, right! Let’s go see.

12:12.370 --> 12:16.250
Maybe the Sky people also returned to normal, too.

12:16.620 --> 12:17.900
That would be good…

12:35.190 --> 12:39.440
Urin, Urin! Did you come home?

12:48.390 --> 12:49.620
Urin…

12:55.590 --> 12:56.990
Onee-chan…

12:58.230 --> 13:01.240
I had a horrible nightmare.

13:01.240 --> 13:03.520
It’s all right now, Urin.

13:04.120 --> 13:05.640
That’s good.

13:07.290 --> 13:08.620
In the dream…

13:09.850 --> 13:15.830
…Onee-chan became friends with Sky people and began to hate me.

13:17.100 --> 13:21.630
I worked so hard to not be hated by Onee-chan

13:21.630 --> 13:26.810
by doing the best I could to protect myself.

13:26.820 --> 13:29.530
Then, I kept hearing a weird voice.

13:29.530 --> 13:33.320
It said that Onee-chan already hates me,

13:33.320 --> 13:36.540
and that you would never return.

13:36.540 --> 13:39.670
Urin, that would never happen.

13:40.210 --> 13:41.400
Really?

13:42.850 --> 13:46.720
If Sky people come, will you work with me to defeat them?

13:52.720 --> 13:54.020
You won’t?

13:54.980 --> 13:56.330
Urin…

13:56.330 --> 13:59.400
Sky people are not that scary.

14:01.730 --> 14:03.160
Onee-chan…

14:06.000 --> 14:08.660
Not good! Stay away from her, Priestess of the Sea!

14:09.570 --> 14:09.990
Who’s there?!

14:10.900 --> 14:11.320
Urin!

14:11.880 --> 14:12.980
Sky people?!

14:17.840 --> 14:20.630
No!

14:20.640 --> 14:23.010
Urin, calm down! Urin!

14:34.140 --> 14:35.810
Urin! Wait!

14:38.260 --> 14:40.920
Sedona’s power didn’t disappear.

14:40.920 --> 14:42.520
I can see that.

14:53.230 --> 14:56.410
Just like a song disappearing from an island…

14:58.020 --> 15:02.740
O Sea, O Sky, do not be saddened.

15:02.740 --> 15:05.500
Fighting will always exist.

15:05.500 --> 15:12.760
The unending darkness and the unending light will finally mix.

15:14.820 --> 15:16.540
Do not be saddened.

15:24.420 --> 15:25.810
Urin!

15:25.810 --> 15:28.220
Why are there Sky people here?!

15:28.240 --> 15:30.700
You care more about Sky people than me?

15:30.720 --> 15:31.830
You’re wrong!

15:32.470 --> 15:36.090
As I thought, this is the place I should return to.

15:39.080 --> 15:40.870
You’re right…

15:41.760 --> 15:43.370
Who is she talking to?

15:43.370 --> 15:44.800
Sedona…

15:45.840 --> 15:47.750
I love her…

15:47.750 --> 15:53.010
I really love Onee-chan a lot!

15:54.760 --> 15:58.610
We’re happy when we’re together.

15:58.610 --> 16:02.920
I thought we could be together forever.

16:02.920 --> 16:05.030
That’s what I thought, too!

16:05.480 --> 16:07.230
Urin! I love you!

16:08.380 --> 16:12.270
Don’t get tricked by the light.

16:12.270 --> 16:15.160
The light takes away darkness.

16:16.610 --> 16:18.620
That voice… Sedona?

16:20.010 --> 16:20.920
I understand.

16:22.000 --> 16:24.780
Take away the heart of light.

16:24.780 --> 16:29.050
Let them be swallowed by the heart of darkness and feel deep sorrow.

16:29.050 --> 16:33.040
Sedona! Give Urin back to me. Don’t torture her anymore!

16:33.040 --> 16:34.180
Marin!

16:48.500 --> 16:51.940
To protect the Sea and Sky, O great light…

16:53.050 --> 16:54.360
shine over…

16:56.030 --> 16:57.020
…the deep darkness.

17:08.620 --> 17:10.460
It was all because of this heart of light…

17:11.280 --> 17:15.630
Because of this heart of light, Onee-chan sided with the Sky people.

17:20.650 --> 17:23.450
I hate them. They should just disappear!

17:28.590 --> 17:32.360
That’s bad! Stop! Don’t give her anymore light!

17:32.360 --> 17:35.280
But this is the only way to save Urin!

18:02.560 --> 18:03.520
What?!

18:18.140 --> 18:20.280
No way…

18:24.580 --> 18:26.330
How could this happen?

18:36.280 --> 18:39.130
You two are no longer Priestesses,

18:40.070 --> 18:44.100
so discard your hearts of light, quickly.

18:52.470 --> 18:53.360
What is this?

18:53.900 --> 18:55.610
What is happening?

18:56.020 --> 19:00.030
How does the heart of darkness feel? Comfortable, right?

19:01.040 --> 19:03.300
This is the heart of darkness…

19:03.300 --> 19:06.450
No! It came into my body of its own accord…

19:07.630 --> 19:08.910
I feel sick…

19:11.920 --> 19:14.630
I can feel my power…

19:14.630 --> 19:18.920
A heart of darkness… feels like this…

19:18.920 --> 19:22.260
Just like the feeling from the eclipse.

19:22.730 --> 19:24.430
Is this the end?

19:25.350 --> 19:28.220
We’ve done all we could.

19:32.340 --> 19:33.690
This is…

19:36.260 --> 19:37.110
What?

19:38.130 --> 19:39.590
We…

19:48.310 --> 19:54.540
Kanon, please help us. I’m begging you.

19:57.060 --> 19:59.460
I came to protect Onee-chan.

20:00.420 --> 20:03.970
Hold it together! Don’t say stupid things!

20:03.970 --> 20:07.550
Marin is my most important friend.

20:13.480 --> 20:18.480
This is the sorrow we threw into the sea.

20:19.320 --> 20:22.900
Why? These are…

20:24.380 --> 20:32.580
Right. These hearts of darkness are the sorrow the island people threw away.

20:39.270 --> 20:42.690
The sorrows of people unable to tell others one’s feelings.

20:42.690 --> 20:45.300
The sorrows of separating.

20:45.740 --> 20:48.720
The sorrows of being unable to understand each other.

20:48.720 --> 20:52.060
The countless sorrows.

20:52.060 --> 20:56.520
This is the true form of Sedona.

21:00.710 --> 21:02.240
Ooshima.

21:10.940 --> 21:12.500
Miyako-okaasan.

21:13.350 --> 21:19.240
Even when my father died, she never cried in front of me.

21:20.960 --> 21:22.010
Kanon-chan.

21:23.630 --> 21:27.890
The turtle seems to have been mistaken about something.

21:28.390 --> 21:33.680
Sedona said the darkness would make the light fade away.

21:34.720 --> 21:41.860
That darkness is the hearts we threw away.

21:42.930 --> 21:46.700
So it’s not scary at all.

21:46.700 --> 21:53.160
Soon, I’m sure we’ll save Urin…

22:26.820 --> 22:31.740
hikari no yurikago

22:26.820 --> 22:31.740
Within a droplet of water,

22:32.160 --> 22:35.290
shizuku no naka ni

22:32.160 --> 22:35.290
a cradle of light

22:35.620 --> 22:38.540
tojikometara

22:35.620 --> 22:38.540
is trapped.

22:38.540 --> 22:43.710
mizu no iro ni naru

22:38.540 --> 22:43.710
And so, it colors the water.

22:44.130 --> 22:47.340
mimi wo sumashite

22:44.130 --> 22:47.340
Clear your ears

22:47.340 --> 22:50.010
eien e

22:47.340 --> 22:49.930
to eternity.

22:50.010 --> 22:55.310
hitori de yume no ato

22:50.090 --> 22:55.310
Beyond a lonely dream,

22:55.310 --> 23:00.650
tsunaide yukeba

22:55.310 --> 23:00.650
if one connects with another,

23:01.350 --> 23:07.240
sotto kurikaesu kagayaki

23:01.350 --> 23:07.240
the repeating, soft shine

23:07.650 --> 23:12.280
warattemo attete

23:07.650 --> 23:12.280
meets and smiles,

23:12.280 --> 23:19.460
mou sukoshide kokoro ga todoku kara

23:12.280 --> 23:19.460
and with just a little more, the hearts have been reached.

23:19.460 --> 23:24.170
toumeina inori de

23:19.460 --> 23:24.040
With a transparent prayer,

23:24.170 --> 23:33.510
yasashiikuchikamu wo tsutsumuyo

23:24.170 --> 23:33.510
concealed within a gentle mouth.

23:35.480 --> 23:38.650
Did you know? Mother seahorses lay eggs.

23:38.650 --> 23:40.500
Then, they grow up in their father’s stomach.

23:40.500 --> 23:41.210
It seems…

23:41.290 --> 23:42.460
This is love!

23:42.990 --> 23:44.560
Next time, Episode 12:

23:44.560 --> 23:47.030
Heart of the Island,  Heart of the People.

23:45.270 --> 23:49.940
Heart of the Island, Heart of the People

23:47.030 --> 23:49.940
I love everyone!
